  "_comment": "Blueprint: v7g AA arrival delay training config. Trains 4 ordinal CatBoost classifiers P(arr_delay >= 15/30/45/60 min). Run from REPO_ROOT after completing blueprint_dep_v7g.json (both steps) and blueprint_arr_v7g.json. Hub features use positional names (hub_0_, hub_1_, ...) matching the order of features_dep.hub_spillover.hubs in the feature config \u00e2\u20ac\u201d for AA v7g: hub_0=CLT, hub_1=ORD, hub_2=DFW, hub_3=LAX, hub_4=MIA.",
